# Statistiques - v0.1.0-alpha

> The foundation is here, yet there are many things to come.

## ⚡ Features

- Record statistics on your items:
    - Blocks broken with an axe, hoe, pickaxe, shears, or shovel;
    - Damage dealt with a bow, crossbow, mace, sword, or trident;
    - Damage blocked with a shield;
    - Damage mitigated with a helmet, chestplate, leggings, or boots.

___

## 🛠 Upcoming

- New statistics:
    - Killed entities:
        - Killed total entities;
        - Killed hostile entities;
        - Killed neutral entities;
        - Killed passive entities.
    - Shot arrows :
        - Total shot arrows;
        - Successfully hit arrows;
        - Missed shot arrows.
    - Hits :
        - Total given hits;
        - Successful hits;
        - Missed hits.

___

## 🔮 Additional information

- This is the first alpha release of my second *Minecraft* mod. This mod means a lot to me, as it is developed only to fulfill my nerd-needs of statistics when I play the game ; In addition to be a reason for me to train using *Java*. Any feedback are highly welcomed, so don't hesitate to send an e-mail at `noahboos-dev@proton.me`.
